🚀 Trucks-to-Tech: Daily Troubleshooting Playbook

A curated collection of real-world troubleshooting drills demonstrating step-by-step technical reasoning, escalation logic, and root-cause identification.

📘 How to Use This Playbook

This playbook is designed to help you:

Track your troubleshooting growth

Document realistic IT problem-solving scenarios

Build a professional knowledge base

Prepare for helpdesk, desktop support, and SOC analyst roles

Showcase hands-on debugging skill on GitHub

Each drill includes:

Difficulty rating

Scenario

Environment

Step-by-step troubleshooting

Root cause

Lesson learned


